{"4063120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Barsuk: The Exile", "steam_appid": 4063120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Old-school action RPG with modern visuals.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay monsters, grow stronger, and earn every piece of power.<br>No auto-play. No shortcuts.<br><br><strong>About the Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an <strong>old-school action RPG</strong> focused on combat, progression, and player skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no hand-holding systems.<br>You grow stronger by fighting, learning, and improving your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is built around a simple core loop:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain power!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on stronger challenges!<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time action combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character progression based on gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging enemies and bosses<br><br><strong><i>Demo Information</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The demo offers a short but focused experience of the core gameplay.<br>Progress is limited and ends before major content unlocks.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Wishlist the game to follow development and future updates!</i></strong></p></li></ul></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Old-school action RPG with modern visuals.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay monsters, grow stronger, and earn every piece of power.<br>No auto-play. No shortcuts.<br><br><strong>About the Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an <strong>old-school action RPG</strong> focused on combat, progression, and player skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no hand-holding systems.<br>You grow stronger by fighting, learning, and improving your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is built around a simple core loop:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain power!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on stronger challenges!<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time action combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character progression based on gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging enemies and bosses<br><br><strong><i>Demo Information</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The demo offers a short but focused experience of the core gameplay.<br>Progress is limited and ends before major content unlocks.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Wishlist the game to follow development and future updates!</i></strong></p></li></ul></li></ul>", "short_description": "Old-school action RPG focused on real-time combat and character progression. Slay enemies, grow stronger, and earn your power through gameplay. No auto-play. No shortcuts. Just combat, loot, and progression.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063120/f25e4420dde4e895b8b5c88246f669854e21603c/header.jpg?t=1773008941", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063120/39da7c9e92a4d857735f95f56ed721d25204eab4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773008941", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063120/39da7c9e92a4d857735f95f56ed721d25204eab4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773008941", "website": null, "p